The King will now have the strength of the Black Pa nther stripped away . Staring T'Challa down, Killmonger suddenly turns to Zuri . They recognize each other. Zuri looks away ashamed.
ກະສັດດຽວນີ້ຈະມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມແຂງຂອງກະຕ່າສີ ດໍາ ຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ. ເບິ່ງ T'Challa ລົງ, Killmonger
